{"task_id": "Mbpp/6", "solution": "def differ_At_One_Bit_Pos(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if two non-negative integers differ at exactly one bit position.\n    This is achieved by XORing the numbers and counting the set bits in the result.\n    \"\"\"\n    xor_result = a ^ b\n    # Count the number of set bits (1s) in the XOR result\n    set_bits_count = bin(xor_result).count('1')\n    return set_bits_count == 1"}
