{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings in a numeric string whose digit sum equals the substring\u2019s length.\n    The function iterates through all possible substrings, calculating their digit sum and length.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(input_string[j])\n            current_length = j - i + 1\n            if current_sum == current_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
