{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(array1, array2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if array2 follows the same sequence pattern as array1.\n    This requires a one-to-one mapping between elements of array1 and array2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array1) != len(array2):\n        return False\n\n    map1_to_2 = {}\n    map2_to_1 = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(array1)):\n        el1 = array1[i]\n        el2 = array2[i]\n\n        # Check mapping from array1 to array2\n        if el1 in map1_to_2:\n            if map1_to_2[el1] != el2:\n                return False\n        else:\n            map1_to_2[el1] = el2\n\n        # Check mapping from array2 to array1 (for bi-directional consistency)\n        if el2 in map2_to_1:\n            if map2_to_1[el2] != el1:\n                return False\n        else:\n            map2_to_1[el2] = el1\n\n    return True"}
