{"task_id": "Mbpp/145", "solution": "def max_Abs_Diff(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum difference between any two elements in an array.\n    Assumes array contains only comparable numeric types.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr or len(arr) < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    min_val = arr[0]\n    max_val = arr[0]\n\n    for x in arr:\n        if x < min_val:\n            min_val = x\n        elif x > max_val:\n            max_val = x\n            \n    return max_val - min_val"}
