{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "def sum_range_list(numbers, start, end):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of numbers in a list within a specified range [start, end] inclusive.\n    Raises ValueError if start > end, and IndexError if indices are out of bounds.\n    \"\"\"\n    if start > end:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Start index ({start}) cannot be greater than end index ({end}).\")\n\n    if not (0 <= start < len(numbers) and 0 <= end < len(numbers)):\n        raise IndexError(f\"Indices ({start}, {end}) are out of bounds for list of length {len(numbers)}.\")\n\n    return sum(numbers[start : end + 1])"}
