{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in the array formed by repeating `arr` `k` times.\n    Applies Kadane's algorithm with special handling for multiple repetitions and positive total sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    def kadane(current_arr):\n        \"\"\"Standard Kadane's algorithm to find the maximum contiguous subarray sum.\"\"\"\n        if not current_arr:\n            return 0 # Should not be called with an empty array in this context\n        \n        max_ending_here = current_arr[0]\n        max_so_far = current_arr[0]\n\n        for i in range(1, len(current_arr)):\n            max_ending_here = max(current_arr[i], max_ending_here + current_arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n\n    # If k is 1, the result is simply Kadane's on the original array\n    if k == 1:\n        return kadane(arr)\n\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # Calculate Kadane's for arr concatenated twice.\n    # This covers max sums within a single block or spanning across two blocks.\n    max_double_block_kadane = kadane(arr + arr)\n\n    # If the total sum of the array is positive, including more full blocks\n    # can potentially increase the overall sum beyond what's found in two blocks.\n    if total_sum > 0:\n        # Calculate maximum prefix sum for `arr`\n        max_p_sum = float('-inf')\n        current_p_sum = 0\n        for x in arr:\n            current_p_sum += x\n            max_p_sum = max(max_p_sum, current_p_sum)\n        \n        # Calculate maximum suffix sum for `arr`\n        max_s_sum = float('-inf')\n        current_s_sum = 0\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1, -1, -1):\n            current_s_sum += arr[i]\n            max_s_sum = max(max_s_sum, current_s_sum)\n        \n        # The result is the maximum of:\n        # 1. The best sum found within the first two blocks (`max_double_block_kadane`).\n        # 2. A sum starting with a max suffix from the first block, covering (k-2) full blocks,\n        #    and ending with a max prefix from the last block.\n        return max(max_double_block_kadane, max_s_sum + (k - 2) * total_sum + max_p_sum)\n    else:\n        # If the total sum is non-positive, including more full blocks will\n        # not increase the sum. The maximum sum will be found within the first two repetitions.\n        return max_double_block_kadane"}
