{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "def max_Product(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds a pair with the highest product from a given array of integers.\n    The function assumes the input array has at least two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    # Initialize with the product of the first two elements\n    max_prod = arr[0] * arr[1]\n    result_pair = (arr[0], arr[1])\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            current_prod = arr[i] * arr[j]\n            if current_prod > max_prod:\n                max_prod = current_prod\n                result_pair = (arr[i], arr[j])\n    return result_pair"}
