{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the cumulative sum of Perrin numbers from P0 to Pn inclusive.\"\"\"\n\n    def _p(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Return the Perrin number at index k.\"\"\"\n        if k == 0:\n            return 3\n        if k == 1:\n            return 0\n        if k == 2:\n            return 2\n        \n        # Use iterative computation to avoid recursion overhead\n        p0, p1, p2 = 3, 0, 2  # p0=P(i-3), p1=P(i-2), p2=P(i-1)\n        for i in range(3, k + 1):\n            p_next = p0 + p1  # P(i) = P(i-3) + P(i-2)\n            p0, p1, p2 = p1, p2, p_next\n        return p2\n\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total += _p(i)\n    return total"}
