{"task_id": "Mbpp/620", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef largest_subset(numbers: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the size of the largest subset of numbers where every pair is divisible.\n    Uses dynamic programming, sorting the input to ensure correct processing.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0\n\n    sorted_nums = sorted(numbers)\n    n = len(sorted_nums)\n    dp = [1] * n  # dp[i] stores the size of the largest divisible subset ending with sorted_nums[i]\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if sorted_nums[i] % sorted_nums[j] == 0:\n                dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)\n\n    return max(dp)"}
