{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum, endnum):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing the digit zero are excluded as division by zero is undefined.\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    result = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        is_valid_num = True\n        num_str = str(num)\n        for char_digit in num_str:\n            digit = int(char_digit)\n            if digit == 0:\n                is_valid_num = False\n                break\n            if num % digit != 0:\n                is_valid_num = False\n                break\n        \n        if is_valid_num:\n            result.append(num)\n            \n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "def capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Inserts spaces before capital letters that start new words in a string.\n    Processes the string in a single pass to achieve O(n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = []\n    for i, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        if i > 0 and char.isupper() and input_string[i-1].islower():\n            result.append(' ')\n        result.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
