{"task_id": "Mbpp/791", "solution": "def remove_nested(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return a new tuple containing all non-tuple elements from input_tuple,\n    preserving their original order.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _flatten(t):\n        result = []\n        for item in t:\n            if isinstance(item, tuple):\n                result.extend(_flatten(item))\n            else:\n                result.append(item)\n        return result\n\n    return tuple(_flatten(input_tuple))"}
