{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(arr: List[Any], target: Any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the index of the last occurrence of *target* in *arr*, or -1 if not found.\n    It uses a modified binary search with O(log n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # search right to find last occurrence\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n\n    return result"}
